abstract: "Exact algebraic witness (a Jordan block in the constrained principal symbol) and a 36-check verification suite for a theorem that, for a charged Pauli-coupled massive Rarita-Schwinger field on R x S^2(1) x S^2(3) with parallel magnetic field at an explicit parameter point, existence, uniqueness and a loss-free L^2 bound cannot hold together on small backward light cones. AI-collaborative; not peer reviewed."
